676
01:06:19,584 --> 01:06:21,850
Keep moving... keep moving,
friends... move forward.

677
01:06:22,640 --> 01:06:27,191
Victory awaits you!
Friends, keep moving.

678
01:06:27,353 --> 01:06:33,311
With Ram's name on
the lips, move ahead, friends.

679
01:06:33,466 --> 01:06:37,895
Keep moving... keep moving,
friends... move forward.

680
